>>
/C [1.0 0.819611 0.0]
/Contents <>
/CreationDate (D:20161007083856+01'00')
/F 28
/M (D:20161007083901+01'00')
/NM (82c9ea92-0b38-46a1-b30f-b3efbd899c79)
/Name /Comment
/P 37 0 R
/Popup 600 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:15.17.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:+6.0pt;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">5</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic">Manual therapy&#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">The reviews commonly cited an absence of research with long-term follow-ups in this area \(van der Wees, Lenssen et al. 2006, Bleakley, McDonough et al. 2008, Terada, Pietrosimone et al. 2013, Loudon, Reiman et al. 2014\) and thus recommended the completion of future appropriately designed randomised controlled trials to determine if the benefits of manual therapy persist beyond short term follow-ups and to ascertain the mechanisms by which these benefits are achieved \(Terada, Pietrosimone et al. 2013\).&#13;</span></p></body>)
/Rect [353.418 74.8657 371.418 92.8657]
/Subj (Sticky Note)
/Subtype /Text
/T (Cailbhe)
/Type /Annot
>>
endobj
600 0 obj
<<
