>>
/C [1.0 0.819611 0.0]
/Contents <>
/CreationDate (D:20161007084622+01'00')
/F 28
/M (D:20161007084740+01'00')
/NM (8e6c1603-db42-431e-83a5-f154452243d6)
/Name /Comment
/P 43 0 R
/Popup 850 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:15.17.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Surgical interventions&#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:+6.0pt;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">14</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">A frequent inclusion criterion of these studies was mechanical laxity at the ankle joint \(Larsen 1990, Hennrikus, Mapes et al. 1996, Karlsson, Eriksson et al. 1997, Karlsson, Lundin et al. 1999, Rosenbaum, Engelhardt et al. 1999, Hoiness, Engebretsen et al. 2003\). &#13;</span></p></body>)
/Rect [60.8925 512.291 78.8925 530.291]
/Subj (Sticky Note)
/Subtype /Text
/T (Cailbhe)
/Type /Annot
>>
endobj
850 0 obj
<<
