/C [1.0 0.819611 0.0]
/Contents <>
/CreationDate (D:20161009083026+01'00')
/F 28
/M (D:20161009083030+01'00')
/NM (658055a6-995f-41a7-bf04-1ea73ddb6a3d)
/Name /Comment
/P 43 0 R
/Popup 862 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:15.17.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:+6.0pt;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">24</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">These conclusions were likely based on three of the individual reports \(2RCTs, 1non-RCT; N = 545; 99% male, 1% female\). Two studies investigated the efficacy of orthotics for preventing ankle sprain recurrence \(Tropp, Askling et al. 1985, Mohammadi 2007\) and one for improving dynamic postural stability \(Gudibanda and Wang 2005\), with no beneficial effects noted.&#13;</span></p></body>)
/Rect [367.738 349.663 385.738 367.663]
